The source directory is mounted at /opt/keycloak/data in the container.
Use a bind mount
```
var keycloak = builder.AddKeycloak("keycloak")
.WithDataBindMount("mydata");
```

The volume is mounted at /opt/keycloak/data in the container.
Use a data volume
```
var keycloak = builder.AddKeycloak("keycloak")
.WithDataVolume();
```

